            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Great!\r\n> \r\n> Let's now try to be on the same page regarding plugin install:\r\n\r\nSorry if I wasn't clear. I've already tested with minimal config and was **not** able to reproduce the error. It worked exactly as you suggest. I just can't figure out what could possibly be in my config that could interfere with it. I performed your test just to double-check and it highlighted the first line with no errors.\r\n\r\n> Oh, and by the way: does only `vaf` cause error? Like do all `daf`, `vif`, `va)` and `va'` lead to this error?\r\n\r\nAll of them lead to this error.",
